# Finish workflow

When a coding task is complete:

1. Commit the task-related changes if not already committed.
2. Build the debug APK **without** bumping the build number:
   ```powershell
   $env:JAVA_HOME = '<Android Studio JBR path>'
   .\gradlew.bat :mobile:assembleDebug --no-daemon
   ```
3. Install the newest generated APK on the `Simple_Automotive` emulator when available:
   ```powershell
   adb install --bypass-low-target-sdk-block -r mobile\build\outputs\apk\debug\engine-sounds-simulator-build-<number>-debug.apk
   ```
4. Bring the app to the foreground:
   ```powershell
   adb shell am start -n com.gabrielpc.enginesoundsimulator/.MainActivity
   ```

Use the newest `engine-sounds-simulator-build-*-debug.apk` in `mobile/build/outputs/apk/debug/`.

Only increment the build number when the user explicitly asks for an APK for the real car:

```powershell
.\gradlew.bat :mobile:assembleDebug -PcarApk=true --no-daemon
```

Do not commit APKs, build output, raw samples, or private reference material.
